  <p>[ <a class="reference internal" href="../index.html#cli-aws"><span class="std std-ref">aws</span></a> . <a class="reference internal" href="index.html#cli-aws-network-firewall"><span class="std std-ref">network-firewall</span></a> ]</p>
<div class="section" id="delete-rule-group">
<span id="cli-aws-network-firewall-delete-rule-group"></span><h1>delete-rule-group<a class="headerlink" href="#delete-rule-group" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h1>
<div class="section" id="description">
<h2>Description<a class="headerlink" href="#description" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
<p>Deletes the specified  RuleGroup .</p>
<p>See also: <a class="reference external" href="https://docs.aws.amazon.com/goto/WebAPI/network-firewall-2020-11-12/DeleteRuleGroup">AWS API Documentation</a></p>
</div>
<div class="section" id="synopsis">
<h2>Synopsis<a class="headerlink" href="#synopsis" title="Permalink to this heading">¶</a></h2>
